WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.380 --> 00:00:03.540
Write code to build a URI
to query the weather

00:00:03.540 --> 00:00:08.200
with location within the weatherEntry
inner class within weatherContract.

00:00:08.200 --> 00:00:11.690
Look at the instructor notes for
a link to the URI builder classes for

00:00:11.690 --> 00:00:13.370
how to do this.

00:00:13.370 --> 00:00:16.370
Uncomment out the test
weatherLocation function within

00:00:16.370 --> 00:00:19.560
test weatherContract to
verify your implementation.

